<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Commercial disclosure</span><h1>Advertising and sponsorship disclosure</h1><p>Payment may buy a clearly labeled placement. It does not buy an undisclosed recommendation or alter an independent editorial ranking.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container policy-copy"><div class="tool-content"><h2>Sponsored placements</h2><p>A company may pay for a separate sponsored box, profile or listing. Sponsored material is labeled close to the placement so readers can distinguish it from editorial content. Paid links use the appropriate sponsored relationship attribute.</p><h2>Editorial rankings stay independent</h2><p>A sponsor cannot pay to become the best alternative, remove a documented limitation or control our conclusion. Products remain ordered according to the article's stated audience and criteria.</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>If an article includes an affiliate link, the relationship is disclosed near the relevant content. The presence or absence of a commission does not change the research standard.</p><h2>Current position</h2><p>Unless an article contains a specific disclosure, readers should not assume a product paid for inclusion. Any future commercial arrangement will be identified on the affected page.</p><h2>For software companies</h2><p>Companies may contact ToolboxKart about clearly labeled sponsorship opportunities. Requests to hide sponsorship, guarantee a ranking or remove a factual tradeoff will not be accepted.</p></div></div></section><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
